    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>3级 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 46；''重伤'' 23</span><span>''先攻'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 19，''强韧'' 16，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 15</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 4，游泳 8</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>前提：该鳄鱼必须没有擒抱生物。攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+8vs.AC<br>命中：1d10+6 伤害，且该鳄鱼擒抱目标（挣脱 DC13）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}粉碎颔✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：近战 1（一个被该鳄鱼擒抱的生物）。目标受到 2d8+3 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+7</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 17（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 12（+2）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 14（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 1（-4）</span><span>''魅力'' 7（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
